<Church title="About us" section="Pages">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About Cedar Grove</h1>
    <p>Cedar Grove Community Church is a fictional congregation, made up to show Nest Co.'s website work. The details on this page are invented.</p>
    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <p>We follow Jesus, read the Bible together and try to love our neighbors in practical ways. We disagree about plenty and still share a table.</p>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pastor Ruth Alderman</strong>, lead pastor</li>
      <li><strong>Elder Marcus Teague</strong>, elder and small groups</li>
      <li><strong>Pantry team</strong>, a dozen volunteers every Thursday</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What we do all week</h2>
    <p>Worship on Sundays, prayer on Wednesdays, a food pantry on Thursdays, and a youth group that meets twice a month.</p>
  </div>
</Church>
